    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Once Before Us</strong> is a story-driven cooperative adventure where two players must work together to uncover the truth buried within a forgotten world. Blending mystery, exploration, and challenging puzzles, the game invites you to communicate, think creatively, and experience<strong>\u00a0</strong>unexpected emotional moments together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two-player Co-op</strong> \u2013 Built entirely around communication and collaboration. No solo mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-Driven Puzzles</strong> \u2013 Every puzzle ties into the narrative. Solving them reveals memories, secrets, and truths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric World</strong> \u2013 Stylized environments and dynamic lighting create a surreal yet emotional tone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Interactions</strong> \u2013 Push, pull, trigger, and combine elements to solve physical and logical challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Occasional Tension</strong> \u2013 While not a horror game, some moments may surprise or disturb.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your partner are not just solving puzzles \u2013 you're uncovering what was <strong>once before you</strong>\u2026 and perhaps, what\u2019s still ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Once Before Us</strong> is a story-driven cooperative adventure where two players must work together to uncover the truth buried within a forgotten world. Blending mystery, exploration, and challenging puzzles, the game invites you to communicate, think creatively, and experience<strong>\u00a0</strong>unexpected emotional moments together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two-player Co-op</strong> \u2013 Built entirely around communication and collaboration. No solo mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-Driven Puzzles</strong> \u2013 Every puzzle ties into the narrative. Solving them reveals memories, secrets, and truths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric World</strong> \u2013 Stylized environments and dynamic lighting create a surreal yet emotional tone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Interactions</strong> \u2013 Push, pull, trigger, and combine elements to solve physical and logical challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Occasional Tension</strong> \u2013 While not a horror game, some moments may surprise or disturb.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and your partner are not just solving puzzles \u2013 you're uncovering what was <strong>once before you</strong>\u2026 and perhaps, what\u2019s still ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>",
